    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418710/extras/dfccec00d9dda54b9cd5329de0b5ff01.poster.avif?t=1753866352\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418710/extras/dfccec00d9dda54b9cd5329de0b5ff01.webm?t=1753866352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418710/extras/dfccec00d9dda54b9cd5329de0b5ff01.mp4?t=1753866352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Lustful BlackJack: My Succubus Dealer&quot;</strong> is a seductive creation that flawlessly blends the gameplay of Blackjack with an adult-themed visual novel. In this captivating card game, players will face off in a battle of wits and allure against a playful and provocative succubus dealer\u2014who is not only an exceptional dealer but also a mischievous trickster capable of stealing your composure when you least expect it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418710/extras/be8d5827ba5b8a5c0da5a8210b1345b4.poster.avif?t=1753866352\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418710/extras/be8d5827ba5b8a5c0da5a8210b1345b4.webm?t=1753866352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418710/extras/be8d5827ba5b8a5c0da5a8210b1345b4.mp4?t=1753866352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Succubus Avena</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avena is the soul of this casino, exuding an irresistible charm with every gesture and glance. Her tone is filled with teasing and mischief, making it nearly impossible for players to focus on their cards. But what is her true intention\u2014challenging your intellect or stealing your sanity?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>&quot;Come on, darling, let me steal your sanity and heartbeat with a single round of cards.&quot;</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418710/extras/f447eb8bfd44850770cae090c59445ca.poster.avif?t=1753866352\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418710/extras/f447eb8bfd44850770cae090c59445ca.webm?t=1753866352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418710/extras/f447eb8bfd44850770cae090c59445ca.mp4?t=1753866352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Highlights</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enchanting Blackjack Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use strategy and luck to compete under the succubus's captivating gaze, with every round becoming a thrilling test of heart and mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exquisite Visual Delights</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features 10 animated HCGs that perfectly capture the succubus's allure and the sweet interactions between characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Distinctive Characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the succubus dealer's playful teasing to the unique charms of two mysterious characters, every interaction brims with surprises and romance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Story Development</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress the plot with each round of Blackjack, unlocking more intimate and engaging interactions along the way</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video 